  "note": "The identities the shipped pcsx2-texture-identities.json does not carry. That document indexed the six containers the uniform lane reads; this one extends the index to the 34 further containers the stadiums, field-art, presentation and faces pages cover -- STADATA.DAT, LOADDATA.DAT and every UIS_*.DAT with decodable MMAP members -- and pairs the same 33 frames against them on exact pixel equality. Result: 6,681 further disc surfaces indexed, 81 textures matched, of which 74 (UIS_TMLO 58, UIS_COMN 10, UIS_IG 6) the first document already carries and 7 are new, every one of them in STADATA.DAT. Nothing new matched in LOADDATA.DAT or in any UIS container the first document had not already reached: the corpus is 32 coin-toss screens and one pre-game frame, and a menu texture is not drawn on either. No pixel is in this file.",
